cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite WhisperX."
title: "whisperx-transcribe: batch audio transcription and diarization in R"
abstract: >-
  An R pipeline that batch-transcribes audio recordings with WhisperX,
  including speaker diarization, and compiles the output into a single tidy,
  timestamped transcript for analysis.
